  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By 6th level, your presence not only adds physical but mental pressure on the enemies. When you successfully shove a creature, you deal bludgeoning damage to them equal to your Martial Arts Die.</p>\n<p>At the start of each of your turns, any creature you have grappled takes bludgeoning damage equal to your Martial Arts Die.</p>\n<p>Additionally, attacks made against you before you have taken a turn in combat have disadvantage.</p>",
